Dead finale video I asked you all to submit

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:11.540
your WTF questions, so I picked 10 of them
to answer in this video with one bonus question.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.669
I also have some gift cards to bestow.

00:00:13.669 --> 00:00:19.140
Real quick, I talk a lot about things that
will influence Season 5.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.000
I go into greater detail about everything
in my Season 5 Predictions video.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.220
That will post later tonight.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:31.640
Time for high fives though, congratulations
to Midoribishi, bokayjunkie and federico mangano.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.080
You guys each win a $20 Amazon gift card.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.310
I’ll message you all on your channels for
details.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:41.510
Don’t worry, I’m still doing a weekly
giveaway for Game of Thrones episodes starting

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.880
again this Sunday.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.410
So 10 more weeks of awesome.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.900
Now it’s time to answer some questions.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.430
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode yet.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:56.070
Here we go, Question 1 - bellez asks (no avatar)
Why are they put them in the train car?

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:59.170
Is that a shrine for all the people they have
lost or eaten?

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:02.710
Why do the people of terminus have the groups
stuff?

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:05.260
How far away are tyrese and carol from Terminus?

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:09.990
All very important things, the finale was
title “A” and everyone kind of thought

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:15.350
it was a reference to Alexandria or because
episode 15 was titled “US” that both episodes

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:18.400
formed this overlapping story called “USA”.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.700
I think what ended up happening is that the
title “A” is just practical.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:27.070
On one hand it references their current predicament
as in, ‘they’re stuck in traincar A’

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:31.340
and it refers to the Terminus itself.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.649
Remember all those maps, and Gareth even said
that all the railroad lines converge there.

00:01:35.649 --> 00:01:40.429
As in railroad line A goes to X, X being Alexandria
in this case.

00:01:40.429 --> 00:01:43.130
Because that is their next major destination.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:47.630
The shrine also has something to do with that
idea of the Terminus as a Focal Point.

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:51.560
Whatever their ideology is, it was pretty
clear they perform human sacrifice, ending

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:53.810
with the consumption of said person.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:56.549
That’s what I think all those names were
on the ground.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:57.970
Their sacrifices.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:02.450
Who or what they’re sacrificing these people
to is unclear, but if they were just straight

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.310
up Hunters, they’d act more like Joe’s
group and not light so many creepy candles

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:08.760
or take the time to engrave runes on the floor.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:14.540
Question 2 - Mikato Tanaka asks Why didn't
Daryl tell Rick Beth got kidnapped?

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:18.580
Or at the very least tell him she was last
seen driving off in a car?﻿

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.770
Daryl isn’t the most forthcoming person.

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:22.800
He talks less than a grumpy teenager.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.250
Or maybe he still is a grumpy teenager.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:29.850
Either way I think he conveyed to Rick that
her status and whereabouts are unknown.

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:33.750
You have to remember how flawed all these
people are, so for every smart thing Rick

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.950
did in this episode, someone was just as likely
to do something stupid.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.590
I guess you could call Daryl’s an error
of omission.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.470
But he didn’t purposefully withhold that.

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:50.120
It’s like when he was trying to tell Beth
that he was happier because her optimism was

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.230
rubbing off on him.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.230
Giant shrug.

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:56.620
Question 3 - Doctor Who 50 and Beyond asks
Do you think that Tyreese, Carol and Judith

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:58.820
became Baby back ribs?

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:03.960
When I read this I actually threw up in my
mouth a little and sang the Austin Powers

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.810
Fat Bastard baby back ribs song.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.450
No, I don’t think they’re dead.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:11.530
As of that last moment, in the timeline, I
don’t think any of the Survivors had been

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:12.530
killed yet.

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:15.160
That doesn’t mean they won’t when the
season comes back.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.660
Also, think about the cannibals this way.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:22.720
You want the most meat you can get per person,
anyone who is a farmer will understand.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:27.880
They’d start with the biggest person first
and maybe even fatten them up before eating

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:28.880
them.

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:31.690
They’d feed way more creepy psycho’s that
way.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:35.550
It doesn’t look like they’re killing people
for pleasure, just as part of some weird ritual

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:36.880
and for sustenance.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:40.680
I guess that means Tyreese and Abraham would
be the first to go, but we really won’t

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:42.870
know until that first couple of episodes.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:46.011
Question 4 - Calvert Thomas asks Where are
they in Georgia﻿

00:03:46.011 --> 00:03:49.790
They’re probably in Macon, Georgia based
on the Terminus map.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.771
If you look here at a real life map, it pretty
much looks the same.

00:03:53.771 --> 00:03:57.070
Question 5 - Bokayjunkie asks Was the whole
“new sheriff in town” Beth flashback moment

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.900
foreshadowing for something?

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:02.330
I think it’s just foreshadowing Beth’s
character development in season 5.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.970
Like she’s going to be taking a new role.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:09.180
Robert Kirkman said that we might not necessarily
see a lot of Beth, we might not find out what’s

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.940
up with her for a while.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:15.810
That implies that she wasn’t taken to Terminus
and whoever grabbed her was someone different.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.919
Everyone refer back to the Jesus and Gabriel
theories.

00:04:18.919 --> 00:04:23.930
Emily Kinney hasn’t been demoted from series
regular status, so she’s not off the show

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.699
or anything, we will see her in episodes.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:28.509
Just probably not as many.

00:04:28.509 --> 00:04:32.580
If everyone is at Terminus right now, they’ll
probably spend most of the episodes there.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.470
So if she’s somewhere else, we probably
won’t see her as much.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:42.729
Question 6 - Cameron Peter asks Could Rick/any
of them, have talked their way into peace

00:04:42.729 --> 00:04:44.720
if they had come as a group?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.680
I don’t think it would have been any different.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.330
Remember that creepy shrine, it said never
trust.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:54.509
So no matter what, the Terminus people would
have never taken them in, and even if they

00:04:54.509 --> 00:04:55.509
did.

00:04:55.509 --> 00:04:59.110
The Survivors would have flipped their shit
when they found out about the human sacrifice

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.560
cannibalism stuff.

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:04.270
So they would have ended up in those shipping
cars no matter what.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:08.830
Question 7 - Soy Taylor asks , During the
running scene when they ran pass some storage

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:12.520
containers were they're cries for help in
the background?

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:16.969
and did anyone else notice the trash on the
way into the train car, was it powered milk?

00:05:16.969 --> 00:05:19.990
Do you think that means that Carol, Tyreese,
and the baby are already there?﻿

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:25.479
I listened to it again and it didn’t quite
sound like them.

00:05:25.479 --> 00:05:33.080
It sounded like someone young, but not Beth
and a man, but not Tyreese.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:36.240
I think they’re reveal who they are in episode
1.

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:40.370
Maybe they’ll be like redshirts to the cannibals
and will just ‘eat it’ so to speak in

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.909
the first half of the episode.

00:05:41.909 --> 00:05:44.620
As an example of what’s really going on
there.

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:49.240
As for the powdered milk, the camera did linger
on it for an unusually long time, so that

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.940
means it’s an important detail.

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:54.229
If Carol, Tyreese and Judith are at Terminus.

00:05:54.229 --> 00:05:58.199
I think it’s more likely they’re being
kept somewhere separate, not in one of the

00:05:58.199 --> 00:05:59.199
containers.

00:05:59.199 --> 00:06:02.080
But yes, I do feel like powdered milk equals
baby.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.400
Fingers crossed that Judith is okay.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:09.069
Question 8 - Cheap Munch asks do you think
Tyrese will have something to do with their

00:06:09.069 --> 00:06:11.659
escape next season?﻿ How are they going
to escape?

00:06:11.659 --> 00:06:16.310
Rick’s final statement basically lets you
know that they’re going to escape somehow.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.419
And they have to get to Alexandria eventually.

00:06:18.419 --> 00:06:22.160
Following up on the powdered milk theory,
if Tyreese isn’t in a container and they

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:25.560
let a few people out to question or sacrifice
them.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:28.169
They can buddy up and start killing Terminus
people.

00:06:28.169 --> 00:06:31.530
They’d have to have at least 3 or four people
loose, otherwise they’d be overwhelmed and

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:35.330
the other Terminus people would just execute
anyone left in Container A.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.220
So there’s a lot of if’s.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:47.360
I would say that Morgan is probably going
to help them out.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:51.090
He’s supposed to be back eventually and
there was a rumor that Scott Gimple was going

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.389
to insert him somewhere in season 4.

00:06:53.389 --> 00:06:57.439
Since we didn’t see him in the finale, it’s
possible that he could show up in the premiere.

00:06:57.439 --> 00:07:01.879
He’s one of the few crazy people with the
intellect and resources to pull of a break

00:07:01.879 --> 00:07:02.879
out.

00:07:02.879 --> 00:07:06.729
So Tyreese plus Morgan plus Crazy Rick equals
escape.

00:07:06.729 --> 00:07:11.490
Question 9 - James Kirk asks What if Beth
wasn’t taken by Terminus and instead by

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:14.669
Jesus.

00:07:14.669 --> 00:07:20.270
So I already mention the Jesus Gabriel possibility,
but let me take it a little bit further.

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:25.979
If Jesus took Beth to Hilltop or Alexandria,
then it’s likely that her story will play

00:07:25.979 --> 00:07:27.819
out at one of those locations.

00:07:27.819 --> 00:07:29.529
Which I think is pretty cool.

00:07:29.529 --> 00:07:33.529
It gives her an opportunity to become more
of a Carol-type badass, hopefully she’ll

00:07:33.529 --> 00:07:36.919
be able to maintain some of the smile that
Carol seems to have lost.

00:07:36.919 --> 00:07:41.251
But yes, it really is seeming more and more
likely that Beth is one step ahead of the

00:07:41.251 --> 00:07:47.180
survivors in terms of big destinations from
the comics.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:51.319
Question 10 - Oliver asks Do you think the
Survivors will stay at Terminus through Season

00:07:51.319 --> 00:07:52.400
5?

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:57.039
So a couple of new characters were just bumped
to series regular, including Gareth.

00:07:57.039 --> 00:08:02.520
So yes, I think we’ll spend several episodes
at Terminus in Season 5.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:06.110
It’s just too big of a location for them
to just blow through.

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:09.199
Think of all those sets they had to build,
that’s a lot of time and energy to spend

00:08:09.199 --> 00:08:12.380
on something you’re only going to see for
two hours.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:17.340
No idea on which episode it will be before
they head to Alexandria, but plan on two things.

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:22.000
An extended stay at Terminus and two, learning
to enjoy being a vegetarian.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:27.189
and one last Bonus Question - No Sherlock
asks Will there be a three way battle in season

00:08:27.189 --> 00:08:30.250
5 with Rick's group vs Sanctuary vs Saviors?﻿

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:34.990
You’re talking about like the All Out War
going on in the comics right now.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.851
No I don’t think they’ll pile all those
things in the same season.

00:08:38.851 --> 00:08:42.539
There will be a ton more action, but in terms
of big locations and groups we’ll see.

00:08:42.539 --> 00:08:47.210
I think we’ll probably only see one other
big location either Hilltop or Alexandria

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.310
and then just get a peek at the other.

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:52.790
They really do want to stretch the story out
as much as possible.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:57.350
That means they can hold back on Negan, which
is like the next “A” bomb Kirkman drops

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.230
on Rick and the Survivors.

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:02.200
So thank you so much for submitting questions,
this was a ton of fun.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:06.709
I’ll try to do as many Q&amp;As in the future
as possible.

00:09:06.709 --> 00:09:12.970
But my next Walking Dead video will be those
Season 5 predictions.

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.820
Be sure to subscribe to get them.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.370
I’ll be posting them later tonight.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.470
Right now click here to get that video.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:20.910
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post
it.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:21.980
and click here for my season finale review.

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:24.009
Thanks for watching, see you guys again in
a couple hours.

00:09:24.009 --> 00:09:24.519
High Fives!

